graph TD
    User([User]) -->|Accesses| S3[S3 Website Bucket]
    User -->|Views| Dashboard[Dashboard UI]
    
    Dashboard -->|Makes API Calls| APIG[API Gateway]
    APIG -->|Invokes| Lambda[Lambda Proxy]
    Lambda -->|Calls| WA[AWS Well-Architected API]
    
    Lambda -->|Returns Data with CORS Headers| Dashboard
    
    CF[CloudFront Distribution] -.->|Optional| S3
    
    subgraph AWS Cloud
        S3
        APIG
        Lambda
        WA
        CF
    end
    
    subgraph CloudFormation Stacks
        Master[Master Stack] -->|Deploys| Infra[Infrastructure Stack]
        Master -->|Deploys| LambdaStack[Lambda Stack]
        Master -->|Deploys| Content[Content Stack]
        
        Infra -->|Creates| S3
        Infra -->|Creates| CF
        LambdaStack -->|Creates| APIG
        LambdaStack -->|Creates| Lambda
        Content -->|Deploys Files to| S3
    end
    
    classDef aws fill:#FF9900,stroke:#232F3E,color:white;
    classDef stack fill:#1E88E5,stroke:#0D47A1,color:white;
    classDef user fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:white;
    
    class S3,APIG,Lambda,WA,CF aws;
    class Master,Infra,LambdaStack,Content stack;
    class User,Dashboard user;
